PLR2044: treat any Unicode whitespace as empty (`#\x0b`): the formatter strips it, so the
lint appeared only after formatting.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-plr2044-unicode-whitespace.py (ruff_formatter_validity).

diff --git a/crates/ruff_linter/resources/test/fixtures/pylint/empty_comment.py b/crates/ruff_linter/resources/test/fixtures/pylint/empty_comment.py
